Contains a random Legendary weapon or armor piece.', 'Focused Umbral Engram', '469828783'), ('66689', 'Exotic Gear (Common)', 'Unknown', 'Unknown', '470135362'), ('66691', 'Warmind''s Avatar Cloak', 'Unknown', 'Hunter Cloak', '470173412'), ('66693', 'Event Information', '• Earn Medallions from completing Contender or Platinum Cards (acquired from Eva), or ritual activities with your class item equipped. Medallions can be banked at the podium in the Tower for event rewards, and they will contribute toward your class standing!

• Achieving high scores in the "Vying for Supremacy" or "Shoot to Score" quests will allow you to light torches and unlock Tower chests. Tower chests contain event gear, buffs, and glows. Tower chest rewards reset weekly.

• Players in the Tower with the highest score in Guardian Games Ops and Supremacy receive the Best in Tower Glow for each respective activity.

